step	1	-	Quick guide step 1
line	<col=000080>Talk to <col=800000>Kolodion</col> at the <col=800000>Mage Arena</col> bank located in level 53 <col=800000>Wilderness</col> to receive an <col=800000>enchanted symbol</col>.</col>
step	2	-	Quick guide step 2
line	<str>Talk to Kolodion at the Mage Arena bank located in level 53 Wilderness to receive an enchanted symbol.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Use the <col=800000>enchanted symbol</col> in various areas in the Wilderness by process of "<col=800000>hot & cold</col>", to find the location a follower spawns in. The location is random and different for each player, and changes occasionally.</col>
step	3	-	Quick guide step 3
line	<str>Talk to Kolodion at the Mage Arena bank located in level 53 Wilderness to receive an enchanted symbol.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the enchanted symbol in various areas in the Wilderness by process of "hot & cold", to find the location a follower spawns in. The location is random and different for each player, and changes occasionally.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Bring the appropriate <col=800000>god staff</col> for the first follower you choose to kill and enough runes for at least 50 casts of the respective <col=800000>god spell</col>.</col>
step	4	-	Quick guide step 4
line	<str>Talk to Kolodion at the Mage Arena bank located in level 53 Wilderness to receive an enchanted symbol.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the enchanted symbol in various areas in the Wilderness by process of "hot & cold", to find the location a follower spawns in. The location is random and different for each player, and changes occasionally.</str>
line	
line	<str>Bring the appropriate god staff for the first follower you choose to kill and enough runes for at least 50 casts of the respective god spell.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Go to the location of the follower you choose to kill and use the <col=800000>enchanted symbol</col> to spawn the follower.</col>
